{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "0G2L", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-quasi-finite}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:eda230a78f98901682621e5914d7590e78ffe3f5001fd43c7aa8fa1df03a6f39", "source_text": "Quasi-finite morphisms", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7a77041db6f9ac32029d2087ab2223d68e88092961e0476fc8848a98751b461c", "unit_id": "tag:0G2L:title"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "0G2L", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{section-locally-quasi-finite}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{section-quasi-compact}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-definition-locally-quasi-finite}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{stacks-properties-section-properties-morphisms}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:92a457a4a289b1d2de57a80d4f60f0a54c8cb1e291477829bbed81e71b9fdb48", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe have defined ``locally quasi-finite'' morphisms of algebraic stacks\nin Section <REF_0001> and ``quasi-compact'' morphisms\nof algebraic stacks in Section <REF_0002>. Since a morphism\nof algebraic spaces is by definition quasi-finite if and only if it is both\nlocally quasi-finite and quasi-compact (Morphisms of Spaces, Definition\n<REF_0003>),\nwe may define what it means for a morphism of algebraic stacks to be\nquasi-finite as follows and it agrees with the already existing notion defined\nin Properties of Stacks,\nSection <REF_0004>\nwhen the morphism is representable by algebraic spaces.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b0cc3a25e099160c7bc3da0c074652ebfcbb4907185711a68f02df61ee1e26be", "unit_id": "tag:0G2L:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "0G2L", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\begin{reference}\n\\cite{rydh_approx}\n\\end{reference}", "MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-locally-quasi-finite}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{definition-quasi-compact}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-quasi-finite}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:1f93466531620815f3586eb4b46eeecc64693912818730b6d19ce234e52d2b29", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a7f3d5521c81913ff76b7188c1ef301b6c3416e34f32c59f241624ea8e38a14b", "source_text": "<LOCKED_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nWe say <MATH_0002> is <TEXTITOPEN_0001>quasi-finite<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> if <MATH_0003> is locally quasi-finite\n(Definition <REF_0001>)\nand quasi-compact (Definition <REF_0002>).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:49c9134c9271a21f77a06ab297d92fbc3be5c3ca6985d399ad2e81dd749c14c9", "unit_id": "tag:0G2M:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0G2L", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-quasi-finite}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b783c3bbd7c488556b256a9dd91747b782356f8d40daf1b2434d6511fbb2aa77", "source_text": "The composition of quasi-finite morphisms is quasi-finite.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:59c761aa65b73cb755dd4506a16045af9b39595224e1aa176e42d94424f7282f", "unit_id": "tag:0G2N:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0G2L", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-composition-locally-quasi-finite}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-composition-quasi-compact}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5a37fa2150175877b804eea95781203857e2112d1454f5a0d95275685e4546af", "source_text": "Combine\nLemmas <REF_0001> and\n<REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:56cd641f642bb7feb554bc83b8217a69e36946f8926700a4f285d2f2e7b1d6b4", "unit_id": "tag:0G2N:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0G2L", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-quasi-finite}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:0388094becf066959e275fe4e3055d936caec9f217017f1a15245b265471a48f", "source_text": "A base change of a quasi-finite morphism is quasi-finite.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:cbe06abeaccf277516806dd80fe8e9f579891b50215653c5b5e06d10c24952c4", "unit_id": "tag:0G2P:statement"}
