{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0G2L", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$g : \\mathcal{Y} \\to \\mathcal{Z}$", "MATH_0003": "$g \\circ f$", "MATH_0004": "$g$", "MATH_0005": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-quasi-finite-permanence}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:8e65fd2cd4516bb493f477762093f251a5b08595dc790e695f999360969dcc5e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7ba0bfbbc007b00d1ab60e1d9b02f00b82a44aebd867d680c1567ad9ad821578", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> and\n<MATH_0002> be morphisms of algebraic stacks.\nIf <MATH_0003> is quasi-finite and <MATH_0004> is quasi-separated and quasi-DM\nthen <MATH_0005> is quasi-finite.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:af47bae42a533f5620bed9b5cff78f4aee040c773524f85011cab89de11a2f0d", "unit_id": "tag:0G2Q:statement"}
